        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 27f42632-7c82-45b3-adbd-070db4289de3).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rOur client, Thomas Batty,  has requested that we put a dent in the small town&apos;s police force as well as taking out his cousin, James Batty. Our client&apos;s cousin has recently dragged him into a violent legal dispute with a local resident and former Providence constant Janus. Our client has asked to use James Batty&apos;s very own axe to kill him just to drive it home.\r\rKilling the two police officers is simply to keep suspicion low and make the kills seem random.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.25.0.0",
